 :: HAPPYLAND ADVENTURES :::::: [1/1] ::
Classic jump'n'run combined with original
puzzle elements,a game full of surprises.
Explore the big levels and collect fruits
for bonus. Save the Happylanders in order
to  rid the world  of evilness.  Art from
Ari  Feldman's  Sprtelib.  Music  from PD
archives.  Prog.  and design Johan Peitz.
(c) Johan Peitz 2000. Reqs: Pentium, 4 MB
ram,  VGA display,  about 1 MB free disk. 
Soundcard and gamepad is optional.
